                    <p class="text-slate-300 font-medium">এক্সেল (.xlsx) বা .csv ফাইল সিলেক্ট করুন।</p>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">A: Date | B: Name | C: Phone | D: Voucher | E: Bill | F: Paid | G: Type (Bank/Cash) | H: Bank Name</p>
                </div>

                <div class="relative">
                    <input type="file" id="excel-file" accept=".xlsx, .xls, .csv" class="m3-field py-10 border-dashed border-2 border-slate-700 text-center hover:border-blue-500/50 transition-all">
                </div>

                <button class="m3-btn-primary w-full py-4 text-lg" onclick="processExcelUpload()" id="process-excel-btn">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-upload"></i> ফাইল আপলোড ও সেভ করুন
